1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,660
Seriously? This is way too much homework for anyone to have to do. I can't see me finishing

2
00:00:08,660 --> 00:00:15,160
this even with help. I know. This homework is just as bad as we'd heard. This really sucks.

3
00:00:15,820 --> 00:00:20,080
If I want to get this work over with, I need to start studying for my entrance exams.

4
00:00:21,720 --> 00:00:25,720
Maybe I should have started prep school like Sanai. I probably would have been smart.

5
00:00:25,720 --> 00:00:31,380
What do you think, Mugi? Well, maybe you should start around winter.

6
00:00:32,320 --> 00:00:41,660
My family doesn't have the money. Hanabi. I'm gonna confess after I finish the homework.

7
00:00:44,960 --> 00:00:50,060
Then I will too! Are you for real? Let's go at the same time.

8
00:00:50,060 --> 00:00:54,260
In the end, it's about the momentum.

9
00:00:55,720 --> 00:00:56,720
Última

10
00:00:56,720 --> 00:00:58,880
abby

11
00:00:58,880 --> 00:01:00,320
Well, don't I go to the end of it Raw.

12
00:01:00,320 --> 00:01:00,720
Alah

13
