A

14
00:01:02,960 --> 00:01:03,720
It's a

15
00:01:04,840 --> 00:01:05,520
got

16
00:01:05,520 --> 00:01:07,160
a

17
00:01:07,160 --> 00:01:07,720
Music

18
00:01:08,400 --> 00:01:11,480
It's on

19
00:01:13,600 --> 00:01:14,280
a

20
